      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S MAYHEM (4) was well supported last start but didn't deliver when fifth (30.21), beaten 3.5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Can atone. ZIPPING LIPA (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (25.73) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Q Lakeside. Solid record here winning four races. One of the better hopes. STARFIRE TEARS (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 41.37 beating Beautiful Child. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. OLIVER GO (8) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
